  "solution": "Số hạng tổng quát của khai triển là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>5</mn><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>5</mn><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra hệ số của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msup></semantics></math> trong khai triển là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>5</mn><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></semantics></math> tương ứng với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>5</mn><mn>5</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>32</m